# What `docker build` may see. Everything is excluded by default and only the
# files the image needs are let back in, so a new file (a PDF, a .env copy,
# a database dump) can never end up in the image by accident.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!app/
!prompts/

# ...and nothing generated inside those folders.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc